{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-06-27 12:30:00', 'title': 'NICOR GAS AND FOX VALLEY HABITAT FOR HUMANITY BREAK GROUND ON NEW SMART NEIGHBORHOOD™ IN CHICAGOLAND', 'text': 'NET ZERO AFFORDABLE NEIGHBORHOOD DEMONSTRATES THE IMPORTANCE OF NATURAL GAS IN A SUSTAINABLE FUTURE FOR ALL NAPERVILLE, ILL.\xa0, JUNE 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NICOR GAS, SOUTHERN COMPANY AND FOX VALLEY HABITAT FOR HUMANITY ANNOUNCED TODAY THE GROUNDBREAKING OF A NEW COMMUNITY DESIGNED TO BE CARBON-NEUTRAL AND ACHIEVE NET-ZERO IN AURORA, ILLINOIS.'}